    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to BlackJack Math Cross Numbers!</strong><br><br>Tease your brain in this mix of crosswords with blackjack, in this game you need to match all the maths in the colums and lines with 21 as result.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hand-made levels that will test your math skills.<br><br></li><li> Originally composed music to keep you relaxed while solving the puzzles.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to BlackJack Math Cross Numbers!</strong><br><br>Tease your brain in this mix of crosswords with blackjack, in this game you need to match all the maths in the colums and lines with 21 as result.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hand-made levels that will test your math skills.<br><br></li><li> Originally composed music to keep you relaxed while solving the puzzles.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Tease your brain in this ambient logic game where you have to make the math match 21 as a result horizontal and vertically (because we're talking about blackjack, right?) Swap the cards, make the math, repeat. That's all you'll need in order to complete this game!",
